<title>USA: HEI sells FastPoint Light Pen business.</title>
<headline>HEI sells FastPoint Light Pen business.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEI Inc said Thursday it sold its FastPoint Light Pen business to FTG Data Systems, a California company.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Light Pens are devices that manipulate the cursor on Cathode Ray Tube screens used in computer terminals and desktop personal computers.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
